### Unified Payment Gateway - demo script (runnable with the REST Client in IntelliJ / VS Code)
@host = http://localhost:8080

### 0. Obtain a token (only needed when pay.auth.enabled=true)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/token?bizSystem=mall&appId=mall-app

### 1. Balance payment: debited synchronously, succeeds immediately
POST {{host}}/api/pay/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bizSystem": "mall",
  "bizOrderNo": "MALL-BALANCE-001",
  "userId": "U10001",
  "amount": 99.90,
  "subject": "iPhone case",
  "channelType": "BALANCE"
}

### 2. Duplicate checkout: same payNo returned, balance is not debited twice (idempotent)
POST {{host}}/api/pay/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bizSystem": "mall",
  "bizOrderNo": "MALL-BALANCE-001",
  "userId": "U10001",
  "amount": 99.90,
  "subject": "iPhone case",
  "channelType": "BALANCE"
}

### 3. Check the balance (starts at 10000.00)
GET {{host}}/api/ops/account/U10001/balance

### 4. Alipay payment: an RSA2-signed async webhook arrives ~3s later, then is pushed again on purpose
POST {{host}}/api/pay/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bizSystem": "mall",
  "bizOrderNo": "MALL-ALIPAY-001",
  "userId": "U10001",
  "amount": 188.00,
  "subject": "Bluetooth earphones",
  "channelType": "ALIPAY"
}

### 5. WeChat payment: the webhook's business fields are AES-GCM encrypted
POST {{host}}/api/pay/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bizSystem": "mall",
  "bizOrderNo": "MALL-WECHAT-001",
  "userId": "U10002",
  "amount": 66.00,
  "subject": "Mechanical keyboard",
  "channelType": "WECHAT"
}

### 6. Automatic routing: no channelType, and 60,000 exceeds WeChat's cap, so it lands on Alipay
POST {{host}}/api/pay/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bizSystem": "mall",
  "bizOrderNo": "MALL-AUTO-001",
  "userId": "U10001",
  "amount": 60000.00,
  "subject": "Large order - automatic routing",
  "region": "CN"
}

### 7. Auto-closed after one minute (demonstrates expiry closing + the stock-release event)
### Note: the simulated channel pays within ~3s by default, so start with a long webhook delay first:
###   mvn spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.arguments=--pay.mock.webhook-delay-seconds=600
POST {{host}}/api/pay/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bizSystem": "mall",
  "bizOrderNo": "MALL-EXPIRE-001",
  "userId": "U10001",
  "amount": 1.00,
  "subject": "Expiry-closing demo",
  "channelType": "ALIPAY",
  "expireMinutes": 1
}

### 8. Look up a pay order by business order number
GET {{host}}/api/pay/biz?bizSystem=mall&bizOrderNo=MALL-ALIPAY-001

### 9. List recent pay orders
GET {{host}}/api/pay/list?limit=20

### 10. Webhook log: shows the duplicate webhook marked DUPLICATE
GET {{host}}/api/ops/webhooks?limit=50

### 11. Notifications the upstream business system received
GET {{host}}/api/ops/notifications

### 12. Outbox rows (replace bizKey with a real payNo)
GET {{host}}/api/ops/messages?bizKey=REPLACE_WITH_PAY_NO

### 13. Re-push a channel webhook by hand to verify gateway idempotency
POST {{host}}/api/ops/mock/resend-webhook?payNo=REPLACE_WITH_PAY_NO&channelType=ALIPAY

### 14. Partial refund
POST {{host}}/api/refund/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payNo": "REPLACE_WITH_PAY_NO",
  "bizRefundNo": "MALL-REFUND-001",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "reason": "user cancelled part of the order"
}

### 15. List every refund order for a pay order
GET {{host}}/api/refund/pay/REPLACE_WITH_PAY_NO

### 16. List channels (secrets masked)
GET {{host}}/api/ops/channels

### 17. Disable Alipay to demonstrate channel failover
POST {{host}}/api/ops/channels/ALIPAY/switch?enabled=false

### 18. Re-enable Alipay
POST {{host}}/api/ops/channels/ALIPAY/switch?enabled=true

### 19. Trigger today's reconciliation (injects missing/extra/mismatched entries)
POST {{host}}/api/ops/reconcile/run

### 20. View the discrepancy records
GET {{host}}/api/ops/reconcile/diffs

### 21. Mark a discrepancy as handled
POST {{host}}/api/ops/reconcile/diffs/1/handle?remark=raised with the channel and backfilled

### 22. Compensating channel query (corrects the local order when a webhook was lost)
POST {{host}}/api/pay/REPLACE_WITH_PAY_NO/sync
